{"uid":"tools/minifs_saves.py","name":"minifs_saves.py","qualname":"tools/minifs_saves.py","kind":"module","file":"tools/minifs_saves.py","line":1,"end_line":351,"language":"py","signature":"","params":[],"returns":"","decorators":[],"bases":[],"modifiers":[],"visibility":"public","doc":{"summary":"minifs_saves.py - preserve the guest's saves/ dir across image rebuilds.","description":"Regenerating minifs.bin from scratch wipes everything the guest wrote at\nruntime (Pokemon battery .sav/.rtc and .state savestates live in saves/ on\nMiniFS). Before mkfs runs, this tool extracts the live saves/ tree out of\nthe previous os.img into a staging dir; the Makefile then passes that dir\nback into mkfs, so a rebuild carries the saves forward instead of wiping\nthem. Only doom maps and Pokemon saves persist (PERSIST_SUFFIXES);\nminicraft chunks are skipped with a log line, never packed.\n\nUsage: minifs_saves.py backup <os.img|minifs.bin> <stagedir>\n\nThe saves land in <stagedir>/saves/... (nothing is created when the image\nis missing or carries no saves/ dir). Guest files are written raw by\nminifs_write, never compressed, so extraction is byte-exact; a file found\nwith the compressed flag set or with double-indirect blocks (both outside\nwhat the guest write path produces) aborts with a nonzero exit instead of\nbacking up corrupt data.","params":[],"returns":null,"yields":null,"raises":[],"attributes":[],"examples":[],"notes":[],"see_also":[],"deprecated":"","since":"","style":"plain"},"parent":"","members":["tools/minifs_saves.py::MAGIC","tools/minifs_saves.py::VERSION","tools/minifs_saves.py::BLOCK_SIZE","tools/minifs_saves.py::ROOT_INODE","tools/minifs_saves.py::S_IFMT","tools/minifs_saves.py::S_IFDIR","tools/minifs_saves.py::FLAG_COMPRESSED","tools/minifs_saves.py::DIR_HDR","tools/minifs_saves.py::FT_DIR","tools/minifs_saves.py::PER_INDIRECT","tools/minifs_saves.py::MAX_FILE_BYTES","tools/minifs_saves.py::MAX_TOTAL_BYTES","tools/minifs_saves.py::MAX_ENTRIES","tools/minifs_saves.py::PERSIST_SUFFIXES","tools/minifs_saves.py::u16","tools/minifs_saves.py::u32","tools/minifs_saves.py::Image","tools/minifs_saves.py::FS","tools/minifs_saves.py::valid_name","tools/minifs_saves.py::strict_name","tools/minifs_saves.py::find_partition_base","tools/minifs_saves.py::cmd_backup","tools/minifs_saves.py::main"],"inferred_raises":[],"returns_value":null,"value":"","base_uids":[],"subclasses":[],"calls":[],"called_by":[]}
